### Get Length Primitive

The get primitive will get a value from the source and save it in the target.

```text
getLength <participant> <target>
```
Syntax Structure:
- `get`:
    * Type: *string*
    * This is the identifier for the instruction.
- `<participant>` 
    * Type: *string*
    * This is the name of the participant whose length will be read.
- `<target>` 
    * Type: *string*
    * This is the name of the participant the value will be saved in.

#### Example 1:
Gets the length of a string.

```text
create number name_length
getLength name name_length
```

Pre-transformation state:
```text
{
    "name": "Book Name"
}
```

Post-transformation state:
```text
{
    "name": "Book Name",
    "name_length": 9
}
```